> What's the beef with GDSM?  Wouldn't BlackDSM (disengration resis) be better
> with a cloak of magic resis?  In this way, you can remove the cloak so you
> can make use of those magic traps while reducing your AC as little as 
> possible.

Well, I prefer GDSM over BDSM for 2 reasons:

1) You can gain intrinsic disintegration res by eating a black dragon or two,
eliminating the need for external protection.  (You can't gain magic res as
intrinsic)

2) A cloak of displacement is better, armor-wise, than a magic res cloak, 
since enemies (almost) always miss you on their first attack.  

In general, I value displacement over disintegration resistance, so I find
the GDSM/COD a better combo than BDSM/COMR.

Just my 2 zorkmids,
